DESCRIPTION:Friday 23rd 7:30pm LA VIRGEN DE LA TOSQUERA Argentina. 93m. Dir
 
 Laura Casabé On the eve of the 2001 outbreak\, Natalia falls madly in lov
 
e with her lifelong friend Diego. The romance is interrupted when he meets 
 
the more experienced Silvia. With the help of her grandma Rita\, Natalia de
 
